             approval submitted as one V DECISIONS PACKET row (serial barrier)
H6A Hermes   Independent Slicesâ†’ticket diff check (Claude or Grok; sub-stage of H6,
             ordinary missions) â€” runs after HERMES STEP 6 SELF-AUDIT PASS, before A7
A7  Agents   Implementation wave â€” Codex-only lanes in isolated worktrees,
