- [ ] Thread: `--thread-lane` 30px → 14px at ≤480; visual indent depth capped so text keeps ≥60% of viewport width.
- [ ] Split: meter sides `flex: 0 1 auto; min-width: 64px`; chips fluid; stacking moved to **768** (absorbs stray 760).
